description=Experimental VR, palm-centered arm IK and tracked held items for PZ3D 0.2.2. First person, on foot, single player. Ctrl+Shift+Scroll Lock toggles OpenXR; Ctrl+Shift+Alt+Scroll Lock recenters; Ctrl+Alt+Scroll Lock toggles synthetic arm waving in XR; Ctrl+Alt+Scroll Lock toggles desktop stereo. Press Ctrl+Shift+F10 to save one left/right pair under Zomboid/PZ3D-VR-Test. Desktop stereo needs no headset. OpenXR requires a working runtime or simulated SteamVR. Arm tracking changes visuals only. This is not a playable VR mod.
